{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01JPSLPqnv3xaVreSLxVoGeQ","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Claude Code release notes latest\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Releases · anthropics/claude-code\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - jqueryscript/anthropic-claude-timeline: A public timeline of major Anthropic Claude model releases, product updates, and developer platform milestones. · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/jqueryscript/anthropic-claude-timeline\"},{\"title\":\"Tool release: Claude Code v2.1.274 (was v2.1.273) · Issue #1535 · agent-sh/agnix\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/agent-sh/agnix/issues/1535\"},{\"title\":\"GitHub - VILA-Lab/Dive-into-Claude-Code: A Systematic Analysis and Discussion of Claude Code for Designing Today's and Future AI Agent Systems · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/VILA-Lab/Dive-into-Claude-Code\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code Release Notes.md · GitHub\",\"url\":\"https://gist.github.com/doggy8088/ff1e63d9ebefaa97f393119a38dd374b\"},{\"title\":\"Tool release: Claude Code v2.1.287 (was v2.1.285) · Issue #1598 · agent-sh/agnix\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/agent-sh/agnix/issues/1598\"},{\"title\":\"Releases · anthropics/claude-code-action\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code-action/releases\"},{\"title\":\"Release v2.1.274 · anthropics/claude-code\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases/tag/v2.1.274\"},{\"title\":\"Claude Code 2.1.289 is out: automatic compat updates are off · Issue #140 · duysqubix/claude-office\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/duysqubix/claude-office/issues/140\"},{\"title\":\"claude-code/CHANGELOG.md at main · anthropics-claude/claude-code\",\"url\":\"https://github.com/anthropics-claude/claude-code/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\"}]\n\nBased on the latest web search results, here's information about the latest Claude Code release notes:\n\n## Latest Release: Claude Code v2.1.289\n\nThe most recent version is Claude Code 2.1.289, which includes fixes for deny or ask rules on nested parts of compound shell commands, terminal freezing issues, and Read deny rules not applying to @-mentioned files.\n\nKey additions in v2.1.289 include agent.spawn for teammates, one agent id across plugin hook events, and idle and waiting states in $.agent.list().\n\n## Recent Previous Releases\n\nClaude Code v2.1.287 was published on October 1, 2026, and included additions for URL prompts from MCP servers on the 2025-11-25 protocol for sign-in purposes, with a startup warning on Windows when denying the Bash tool also disables PowerShell.\n\nClaude Code is described as an agentic coding tool that lives in your terminal, understands your codebase, and helps you code faster by executing routine tasks, explaining complex code, and handling git workflows through natural language commands.\n\nFor more detailed release notes, you can visit the official [Claude Code releases page on GitHub](https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases).\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7dc33919-a4cb-4a0c-9753-c178f05fe6e2","uuid":"782d3ccd-b7d2-4036-a5f4-5d9d966e523e","timestamp":"2026-10-04T15:40:13.674Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Claude Code release notes latest","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_014Y4VT1uwEcDNnSCh8zPoUv","content":[{"title":"Releases · anthropics/claude-code","url":"https://github.com/anthropics/claude-code/releases"},{"title":"GitHub - jqueryscript/anthropic-claude-timeline: A public timeline of major Anthropic Claude model releases, product updates, and developer platform milestones. · GitHub","url":"https://github.com/jqueryscript/anthropic-claude-timeline"},{"title":"Tool release: Claude Code v2.1.274 (was v2.1.273) · Issue #1535 · agent-sh/agnix","url":"https://github.com/agent-sh/agnix/issues/1535"},{"title":"GitHub - VILA-Lab